# vela
===
 A cinematic, fully skinnable media client for Ether, Jellyfin, Emby and Plex. Plays original MKV/HEVC/4K files in the browser with in-tab TrueHD, DTS and E-AC-3 decoding, ASS and PGS subtitles, and a Live TV guide built for 10,000+ channels..
